.TH SETXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setxattr \- sets an extended attribute on the file named by path, following symbolic links
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B int setxattr(const char* path, const char* name, const void* value, size_t size, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets an extended attribute on the file named by path, following symbolic links.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setxattr (2)
